        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ah I see, thanks for the reply and the consideration! \n\nYeah, I can see the tradeoff here, and I agree that for delete / change operation it makes more sense to be linewise. I'll try this behaviour and see if I can adapt to it.\n\nAlso, not super important, but I'm curious about your thoughts on the following idea: what do you think if we put the bottom cursor at the end of the line instead of the first non-blank character? That way, it's possible to switch to charwise selection while maintaining the correct selection, e.g. `vaiv`. Just wondering if you have some opinion about it haha.",
